{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22163","headline":"归田三首 三 · 白居易","name":"归田三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十爲近臣，腰间鸣佩玉。\n四十爲野夫，田中学锄谷。\n何言十年内，变化如此速。\n此理固是常，穷通相倚伏。\n爲鱼有深水，爲鸟有高木。\n何必守一方，窘然自牵束。\n化吾足爲马，吾因以行陆。\n化吾手爲弹，吾因以求肉。\n形骸爲异物，委顺心犹足。\n幸得且归农，安知不爲福。\n况吾行欲老，瞥若风前烛。\n孰能俄顷间，将心系荣辱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}